\description{
Say what kind of file a path is - the mzLib file type, its extension, its reader and the cross-format views it offers - without parsing its contents.

The many-files form of \code{\link{readers_identify}}: one bridge process resolves every path, \code{threads}
at a time, and answers in input order.
}
