  order: \code{path}, \code{file_type}, \code{extension}, \code{reader}, a \code{views} list column, \code{is_quantifiable},
  and \code{error_kind}, \code{error_type} and \code{error_message}, which are \code{NA} for a path that was
  identified. \code{file_count}, \code{read_count} and \code{failed_count} count paths.

